    <iconUrl>https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/MKAbuMattar/chocolatey-packages@main/icons/servoshell.png</iconUrl>
    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <description><![CDATA[## What is Servo?

Servo aims to empower developers with a lightweight, high-performance alternative for embedding web technologies in applications.

## Usage

The package installs the `servo` command. Open a new terminal after installing so the PATH change takes effect, then see the [Servo documentation](https://servo.org) for the available options.
]]></description>
    <summary>Servo aims to empower developers with a lightweight, high-performance alternative for embedding web technologies in applications</summary>
